{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LxLfC6FqkvWCXGG4nb-Nog","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:39.857774+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/LxLfC6FqkvWCXGG4nb-Nog","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBBR7BUZ5EibicjC1PMGiajzBJXu8C6IHIchALMVibsPEGLcicp0pBh4jm5w/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生互动与交流，近距离了解安徽医科大学第二临床医学院（第二附属医院）的优势学科、导师团队、科研平台、人才培养和就业前景等，我院将举办2025年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动。现面向全国高校招收营员，欢迎有意报考我院的优秀学子踊跃报名参加本次活动。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJnhGoBpRGvdwTm48XqEl2BkSeEGOuHLazGJia0rpwTK66JYBibmfEnDlA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJaicnDqDoYib4ZuUtXCOibG1zeL9903INeTUEorsctCJlrB17yDoQAeQGg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJiaUuvjTX2eBRMfCBHIhwd8V74UrqHkcibiba0AiabuFjWb8og3YnoptibTQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJLQ3KXYo0ic3a4vQIWtDhtm2ibjy5T5Hal4sQ20HKwQgXLlBIVRXxz7Rw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【单位简介】</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>安徽医科大学第二临床医学院（第二附属医院）是一所集医疗、教学、科研、预防、保健、康复等多功能于一体的三级甲等现代化综合性医院。医院于2008年开诊，2013年率先在安徽省按照原卫生部部颁标准通过国家三级医院等级评审。2017年初，医院以高分通过JCI国际认证（Joint Commission International, 医疗机构评审联合委员会国际部），成为安徽省首家获得JCI认证、全国第十家以学术型医学中心医院通过JCI评审的大型公立医院。医院现拥有3个国家临床重点专科建设项目（眼科、呼吸与危重症医学科、血液内科），14个省临床重点专科，省级临床研究中心1个,教育厅重点实验室1个；2023年获国家自然基金立项33项，位列全国医院前五十强。2024年，首次获得国自然联合基金重点支持项目立项资助3项；省科技进步奖5项，其中一等奖2项；省级教学成果一等奖1项；12个学科位居中国医院科技量值全国百强，6个学科入选五年总科技量值全国百强；罕见病、神经内科、麻醉学、肾脏内科及运动医学入选中国医院及专科声誉排行榜（复旦版）榜单，其中罕见病位列全国13名，神经内科、麻醉科均位列安徽第三名。在国家卫生健康委公布的2022年度全国三级公立医院绩效考核（国考）中位列全国71名，连续三年稳居A+等级。</span></p><p><span>医院目前开放床位2650张，现有员工3270人，其中高级职称609人，博士362人，在站博士后65人，教授34人，博士生导师84人，国家1人、国家重点人才计划青年项目入选者1人；国务院特殊津贴5人、省政府特殊津贴4人、国家卫生健康突出贡献中青年专家2人，国家卫生计生突贡中青年专家1人、省学术技术带头人及后备人选20人、江淮名医14人、省杰青3人、优青5人、省特支2人、皖江学者特聘教授1人、青年皖江学者2人、省卫生系统青年领军人才9人。</span></p><p><span>目前，全院拥有24个学术型硕士招生专业（方向），拥有32个专业学位硕士招生专业（方向），2025年全院招收硕士研究生284人，博士研究生43人。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【报名时间】</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2025年7月5日至2025年7月12日</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【计划营员人数】</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>计划招收营员50人</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【夏令营活动安排】</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次活动预计在7月下旬举行，活动形式以线下的方式进行。具体安排以实际通知为准。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【申请条件】</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法；</span></p><p><span>2.普通高校全日制本科2026届应届毕业生，且有意向报考我院硕士研究生的同学；</span></p><p><span>3.学习成绩应满足下列条件之一：（1）五年制或四年制医学专业学习成绩排名在同专业年级排名前30%；（2）安徽医科大学临床医学5+3专业学习成绩排名应在同专业年级前50%。</span></p><p><span>4.对科研工作有浓厚兴趣，有相关科研经历，并具有较强或潜在的研究能力；</span></p><p><span>5.英语水平满足下列条件之一：CET-6≥425分，CET-4≥480分，雅思IELTS考试≥5.5分，托福TOEFL网考≥90分。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>【申请程序】</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/sFhFQBMtHjWaa3NykUU5DUYvkib1ghFKJBt3f6qDH3pIcTRGHXviapVtwCgibjbgcbDVBc0bI9lGvsHhuVXFuic8PA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.申请表（见附件）；</span></p><p><span>2.本科历年成绩单（加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>3.英语水平的证明材料：全国大学生英语四、六级考试成绩单或相关证书；</span></p><p><span>4.其他相关能力的证明材料（如发表论文、专利、各类获奖证书等。如有，需提供）；</span></p><p><span>5.本人有效期内的身份证和学生证；</span></p><p><span>6.报名汇总表（见附件）。</span></p><p><span>请申请人将上述申请材料（1-5）按顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文件，命名为“夏令营+目前在读的学校名称+个人姓名”，报名汇总表以Excel格式另外发送，于7月12日前发送至邮箱：ay2fyjxb@163.com，逾期不再受理。报名材料在7月14日-16日经过审核通过后将以正式邮件进行通知，并邀请加入夏令营QQ群。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></sectio